  "decision_date": "19/08/2004",
  "description": "Refurbishment of unit 1 to incorporate 3 television studios with office support services including a mezzanine floor, new plant area and external cladding to building.",
  "site_name": "Sky 2",
  "last_updated_by": "Northgate M3",
  "decision_target_date": "31/08/2004",
  "borough": "Hounslow",
  "postcode": "TW7 5QD",
  "street_name": "Grant Way",
  "bo_system": "Northgate M3",
  "development_type": "Major dwellings",
  "lapsed_date": "18/08/2009",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of five years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority (before the building(s) is/are occupied/used).",
    "Condition : 3 - No development shall take place until samples of the materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the hereby permitted have been submitted to and approved in writing by the local planning authority.  Development shall be carried out in accordance with the approved details",
    "Condition : 4 - No additional floorspace shall be formed within the buildings hereby permitted by means of internal horizontal division without prior written consent of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 5 - No works or development shall take place until full details of all proposed tree planting, and the proposed times of planting, have been approved in writing by the local planning authority, and all tree planting shall be carried out in accordance with those details and at those times.",
    "Condition : 7 - Prior to the occupation of the building, 14 cycle racks shall be installed and permanently retained in location to be agreed by the Local Planning Authority unless otherwise agreed by the said authority.",
    "Condition : 8 - The applicant shall submit a travel plan to be agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority, prior to occupation of the building. The agreed plan should be in place and operating on upon commencement of the use. The applicant will be expected top provide a monitoring report to the Council, at yearly intervals, for five years thereafter.",
    "Condition : 9 - If within a period of (two years) from the date of the planting of any tree, that tree, or any tree planted in replacement for it, is removed, uprooted or destroyed or dies, (or becomes, in the opinion of the local planning authority, seriously damaged or defective,) another tree of the same species and size as that originally planted shall be planted at the same place, unless the local planning authority gives its written consent to any variation.\r\n(Reason.  To ensure a satisfactory appearance of the site and improve the visual amenities of the area)",
    "Condition : 10 - The proposed mezzanine floor, additional plant area and refurbishment of unit 1, is outside of a designated employment area of the UDP, the factors of its existing B1 use, previous permissions and proximity to the existing Sky Campus on Grant Way and provision of jobs is considered to outweigh this. It is therefore considered compliant with Policies ENV.B.1.1, ENV.1.8, ENV-N1.5, E.1.1, E.1.2, E.2.1,\r\nE.2.3, E.2.4, E.3.1, T.1.2, and T.1.4 of the London Borough of Hounslow Unitary Development Plan 2003 and where it is not compliant it is not considered that significant harm will be caused by this."
  ],
